{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"弱可缩范畴"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"弱可缩范畴"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"作为 $\\infty$-群胚可视为 $(\\infty,1)$-范畴, 给出嵌入\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Ani} \\to \\mathsf{Cat}.\r\n$$\n该嵌入有左伴随\n$$\r\n|{-}|\\colon \\mathsf{Cat} \\to \\mathsf{Ani},\r\n$$\n“将所有态射变为可逆”.\n(注意该嵌入的右伴随为取"},{"Local":{"url":"对象的生象","text":"对象的生象"}},{"Plain":")</p>\n<p>对于范畴 $\\mathcal C$, 若 $|\\mathcal C|=1$, 则称 $\\mathcal C$ <strong>弱可缩</strong> (weakly contractible).</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 函子 $\\mathcal C_{/c} \\to \\mathcal C$ 保持且"},{"Local":{"url":"反映(范畴论)","text":"反映"}},{"Local":{"url":"弱可缩极限","text":"弱可缩极限"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>. 设 $I$ 为弱可缩范畴, 图表 $X\\colon I\\to\\mathcal C_{/c}$ 的极限是"},{"Local":{"url":"锥(范畴论)","text":"右锥"}},{"Plain":"图表 $\\widetilde {X}\\colon I^{\\triangleright}\\to\\mathcal C$ 的极限, 而 $I\\to I^{\\triangleright}$ "},{"Local":{"url":"共首函子","text":"共首"}},{"Plain":", 故该极限等同于 $\\widetilde {X}|_{I}$ 的极限.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>范畴的"},{"Local":{"url":"锥(范畴论)","text":"锥"}},{"Plain":"是弱可缩的.</p>\n"}]}}